\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Simply trusting every day;
\par Trusting through a stormy way;
\par Even when my faith is small,
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trusting as the moments fly,
\par Trusting as the days go by,
\par Trusting Him whate'er befall,
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Brightly doth His spirit shine
\par Into this poor heart of mine
\par Wile He leads I cannot fall,
\par Trusting Jesus that is all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trusting as the moments fly,
\par Trusting as the days go by,
\par Trusting Him whate'er befall,
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Singing, if my way be clear;
\par Praying, if the path be drear:
\par If in danger, for Him call;
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Trusting as the moments fly,
\par Trusting as the days go by,
\par Trusting Him whate'er befall,
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Trusting Him while life shall last,
\par Trusting Him till earth be past,
\par Till within the jasper walls;
\par Trusting Jesus, that is all.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

